                    311.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) When requested the Company will furnish the Local with a list of Employees and their job mailing addresses, on loan to other Lucent Technologies Inc. entities, other than Employees on regular \"man loan\" orders, as may be agreed upon between the Local and the Company.",
