        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) When Employees are to be transferred between Areas of the Company, the Company will notify the Local from whose jurisdiction the Employee is to be transferred seven (7) days in advance of the date of departure, unless unknown or unforeseen conditions prevent the Company from giving such notice.",
