            "block_content": "(d) When an Employee is to be transferred on a Permanent Transfer, the Company will notify the Local from whose jurisdiction the Employee is to be transferred and the Local which has jurisdiction at the destination Work Location, if applicable, forty-five (45) days in advance of the effective date of such transfer.",
